          </button>
          <div class="faq-body" id="faq4">AS/NZS 5139:2019 covers safety clearances, ventilation, wiring specifications, signage, and documentation for all battery energy storage system (BESS) installations in Australia. Compliance is mandatory. Ask Tradie Brain AI for clearance requirements for specific battery brands or how to document compliance for a CER audit.</div>
