              <button class="lib-qa-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qa-5-1" data-prompt="How do I set up a ServiceM8 job template for a solar and battery installation that is CER-audit ready?">
                How do I set up a ServiceM8 job template for a solar + battery install?
                <svg class="lib-qa-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
