              <div class="lib-qa-body" id="qa-5-1">
                <p>A CER-audit-ready solar + battery job template in ServiceM8 should include:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Job checklists:</strong> Pre-install checklist (site inspection, DNSP notification sent), install checklist (labelling, clearances, commissioning), and post-install checklist (photos uploaded, wiring diagram attached, certificate lodged)</li>
                  <li><strong>Forms:</strong> Customer consent form, installer declaration, STC assignment (RESA) form — all completable in-field via the ServiceM8 app</li>
                  <li><strong>Photo requirements:</strong> Required photos attached directly to the job (array, inverter, switchboard, battery, all signage)</li>
                  <li><strong>Certificate tracking:</strong> A custom field or checklist item confirming CCEW/CES lodgement with lodgement reference number</li>
                  <li><strong>Line items:</strong> All equipment with serial numbers captured during install</li>
