              <div class="lib-qa-body" id="qa-5-3">
                <p>ServiceM8 integrates with Stripe for online credit/debit card payments:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Setup:</strong> ServiceM8 → Add-ons → Stripe → Connect or create a Stripe account</li>
                  <li><strong>Deposit quote:</strong> Create a quote in ServiceM8, add a deposit line item (e.g. "Deposit — 30%"), send to customer via email</li>
                  <li><strong>Pay link:</strong> The quote email includes a "Pay Now" button that takes the customer to a Stripe-hosted payment page — no separate link needed</li>
                  <li><strong>Confirmation:</strong> ServiceM8 records the payment and updates the job status automatically</li>
                  <li><strong>Fees:</strong> Standard Stripe card rates apply (approx. 1.7–2.9% depending on card type) — factor this into your pricing or set a minimum transaction</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Pro tip: send the deposit request the same day as the quote, not when you're ready to book. Acceptance rate drops significantly after 48 hours.</p>
                <button class="lib-ask-btn" data-prompt="How do I take a deposit from a solar customer using Stripe through ServiceM8?">⚡ Ask about ServiceM8 Stripe deposits</button>
