              <button class="lib-qa-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qa-5-4" data-prompt="How do I build an automated follow-up and review request workflow in ServiceM8 for completed solar jobs?">
                How do I automate review requests and follow-ups in ServiceM8?
                <svg class="lib-qa-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
