              <div class="lib-qa-body" id="qa-5-4">
                <p>ServiceM8 Automation lets you trigger SMS and email messages based on job status changes:</p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Post-completion email:</strong> Trigger on "Work Order — Completed" → send a branded email with system handover info, warranty details, and a Google Review link</li>
                  <li><strong>7-day follow-up SMS:</strong> Trigger 7 days after completion → "Hi [name], just checking everything is working with your solar — any questions let us know. Loved working with you! [Review link]"</li>
                  <li><strong>Unpaid invoice reminder:</strong> Trigger 3 days after invoice sent → polite SMS reminder with payment link</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Setup: ServiceM8 → Automation → New Automation → select trigger event → add action (send email/SMS) → customise template with merge fields. Keep messages short and personal — automation that sounds like a person gets far better review conversion than corporate templates.</p>
